[h2]Build 0.9.37[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*]Feeders load machines that take their input into themselves, like Vanilla Recycling Expanded's alloypack splitter and the Biotech wastepack atomizer. Point the Feeder's destination at the machine (or the spot where a pawn would stand to load it): Loaders on the line send exactly as many alloypacks as it has room for, and the Feeder puts them straight in. The machine's own auto-load switch is respected.
[*]Movers can put items straight into those machines too.
[/list]
